                      (    forth6809.asm):07385         ; address - confirmed by tracing CONSTANT's own behavior field:
                      (    forth6809.asm):07386         ; it compiles a raw address to ATSIGN (@) there directly via
                      (    forth6809.asm):07387         ; CODECOMMA, not CREATE's own placeholder mechanism.
                      (    forth6809.asm):07388         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
