E8C1 3606             (    forth6809.asm):11842                  PSHU  D          ; 10,S, which was itself wrong - it assumed
E8C3 39               (    forth6809.asm):11843                  RTS              ; DOSETUP's own JSR-pushed return address
                      (    forth6809.asm):11844                                   ; persists on S once each DOSETUP finishes.
