F894 93AB             (    forth6809.asm):14199                    SUBD UEDST     ; overwriting whatever was left on top of
F896 DDAD             (    forth6809.asm):14200                    STD  UEOUTLEN  ; the stack rather than pushing both
                      (    forth6809.asm):14201                                   ; required return values, and separately,
                      (    forth6809.asm):14202                                   ; UEOUTLEN itself was never correctly
                      (    forth6809.asm):14203                                   ; tracked by the old backslash-decoding
                      (    forth6809.asm):14204                                   ; loop's own per-character bookkeeping in a
                      (    forth6809.asm):14205                                   ; way that accounted for doubled '%'
                      (    forth6809.asm):14206                                   ; characters. Now computed directly as the
                      (    forth6809.asm):14207                                   ; final write pointer (Y) minus the
